WEBVTT

00:08:00.704 --> 00:08:03.829
On the one hand, we might obsessively
brood on our feelings.

00:08:04.788 --> 00:08:06.413
Getting stuck inside our heads,

00:08:07.079 --> 00:08:11.663
hooked on being right or victimized
by our news feed.

00:08:13.454 --> 00:08:15.496
On the other, we might
bottle our emotions,

00:08:15.496 --> 00:08:20.413
pushing them aside and permitting only
those emotions deemed legitimate.

00:08:22.454 --> 00:08:25.704
In a survey I recently conducted
with over 70000 people,

00:08:25.704 --> 00:08:29.121
I found that a third of us, a third,

00:08:29.871 --> 00:08:35.829
either judge ourselves for having
so-called bad emotions like sadness,